Pipeline Diagram

This is a placeholder for the AQuA pipeline diagram.

Replace this file with an actual pipeline diagram image (PNG format, recommended size: 1200x600px).

The diagram should show:
- Design → Build → Review pipeline stages
- Quality gates between stages
- Feedback loops
- Evaluation checkpoints

Recommended tools for creating the diagram:
- Mermaid
- PlantUML
- draw.io
- Excalidraw
